    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d742-a15">

                <pb facs="0819" n="721" sameAs="frus:frus1920v01/pg721"/>

                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Annex 14—Telegram]</seg></opener>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The French Minister of Foreign Affairs</hi> (<hi
                        rendition="#italic">Millerand</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to the French
                        Minister in China</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic">Boppe</hi>)</head>
                <p>Please inform Jezierski that the evidence requested has been issued. Please
                    transmit the following to him: <quote rend="blockquote">
                        <p>“You will receive by the next mail steamer the registered letter with the
                            proof sent you by M. Sahmen, the representative in London of the Russian
                            Ministry of Finance.”</p>
                    </quote></p>
                <p rendition="#flush">The letter of M. Sahmen, representative of the Russian
                    Ministry of Finance and attaché of the Russian Embassy in London, is proof that
                    the shares of the Chinese Eastern Railway belong to the Russo-Asiatic Bank.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Sahmen</hi></signed><lb/><hi
                        rendition="#small-caps">By Director of Russo-Asiatic
                            Bk.</hi><lb/><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Millerand</hi></signed>
                    <lb/><dateline rendition="#float-left">
                        <placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps">Paris</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1920-09-16"><hi rendition="#italic">September
                                16, 1920</hi></date>.</dateline></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
